        <mxCell id="cl" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3B1E54;" value="&lt;b&gt;What makes it different&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;every alternative also produces weights. The question is what the weights are allowed to depend on.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
